---
/*
 * Review with the site owner (ideally with legal advice) before launch,
 * and update when analytics or anything else that collects data is added.
 * EEA/UK/Swiss visitors must see a Google-certified consent message before
 * personalised ads: turn on AdSense "Privacy & messaging" when ads go live.
 */
import LegalPage from '@/components/layout/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config/site';
---

<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" heading="Privacy policy" description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your data, cookies and advertising.`}>
  <p>This policy explains what information {SITE.name} (“we”, “us”) collects when you use this website, how it’s used and the choices you have. In short: the numbers you type into our calculators stay on your device.</p>

  <h2>Numbers you enter</h2>
  <p>
    Every calculation runs in your browser. The values you type are not sent to or stored on our servers. If you use <strong>Share result</strong>, your inputs are added to the page link so
    that whoever opens the link sees the same result. Anyone you share that link with can read those values, so don’t share links containing information you want to keep private.
  </p>

  <h2>Information stored in your browser</h2>
  <p>We use your browser’s local storage, not cookies, for two things that never leave your device:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Theme:</strong> whether you chose light or dark mode.</li>
    <li><strong>Exchange rates:</strong> the currency converter keeps a copy of the latest rates for up to an hour so repeat visits load faster.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>You can clear these at any time in your browser settings.</p>

  <h2>Services we use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Exchange rates.</strong> The currency converter fetches rates from <a href="https://www.exchangerate-api.com" rel="noopener">ExchangeRate-API</a> directly from your browser. Like any website,
      that service receives your IP address and browser details when it sends the rates.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Hosting.</strong> Our hosting provider may keep standard server logs (such as IP address, browser type and pages requested) to keep the site secure and working.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Advertising.</strong> See the next section.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    We show ads from Google AdSense to keep the site free. Google and its partners use cookies and similar technologies to serve ads, measure them and, where you allow it, personalise them
    based on your visits to this and other websites.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>If you’re in the European Economic Area, the UK or Switzerland, you’ll be asked for your consent before personalised ads are shown, and you can change your choice at any time.</li>
    <li>
      You can opt out of personalised advertising at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>, or of many advertising networks at
      <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
    </li>
    <li>Learn more about <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we don’t do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We don’t ask you to create an account or give us your name or email address to use any calculator.</li>
    <li>We don’t sell personal information.</li>
    <li>We don’t currently use analytics or tracking tools of our own. If that changes, we’ll update this page first.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is for a general audience and isn’t directed at children under 13. We don’t knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR in Europe or the CCPA in California), you may have the right to access, correct or delete personal information about you, and to object
    to or limit how it’s used. Because we don’t store the values you enter, we usually hold no personal information about you. For advertising data, use the Google controls above, or contact us and
    we’ll help.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or see our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
